# Google Drive sign-in.
#
# One-time setup, done by whoever builds or installs this copy of Coso:
# 1. In Google Cloud Console, enable the Google Drive API.
# 2. Create an OAuth consent screen (External is fine for personal use).
# 3. Create an OAuth client of type "Web application".
# 4. Add these Authorized JavaScript origins:
#      http://localhost:3000
#      http://localhost:4173
#      (and the real https:// origin when you deploy)
# 5. Paste the client ID below and rebuild.
#
# After that, users only see a single "Continue with Google" button.
# Google never lets an app collect a Google password directly, so the button
# opens Google's own sign-in page.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
